# Test your API endpoints

### 1. Test Authentication (Without Credentials) - Should fail
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Test Authentication (With Credentials) - Should succeed
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=

###

### 3. Get Swagger UI Documentation (No Auth Required)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api-docs
Accept: text/html

###

### 4. Get OpenAPI JSON Specification (No Auth Required)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/openapi.json
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Parse Data - One Time Parser (First Call - Should succeed)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/one-time-data-parser
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=

###

### 6. Parse Data - One Time Parser (Second Call - Should fail)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/one-time-data-parser
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=

###

### 7. Parse Data Without Auth (Should fail)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/one-time-data-parser
Accept: application/json

###
